            "en-us": "Using forceRender"
        },
        "在设置参数`forceRender=True`后，即使折叠面板初始化时处于折叠状态，也会强制提前将内部元素渲染到页面中，从而便于一些初始化回调的正常赋值。": {
            "en-us": "Set `forceRender=True` to render panel content even when initially collapsed, allowing initialization callbacks to update its elements."
